Magic Traps are great.
I had a half decent wizard, who had telepathy, so when you got blinded by steping on the
trap, he could still see the monsters. AMong the affects I got were getting more power,
higher stats, tons of monsters to be killed and eaten, but rarely damage (I think 
getting blinded was the worst thing that happened.) The thing never ran out either,
I just jumped right back in the trap after recouperating from previous fights.

I have a question of my own:
How do you un-agravate monsters? The afore said wizard-character would have been great,
but all the monsters were rather pissed at 'em (accidentaly killed my pet when I was blind..
and I might have eaten him too...)

